OL,3,ACulture Secretary Lisa Nandy facing
OL,4,Aquestions from Kuenssberg - watch live
OL,5,
OL,6,FCulture Secretary Lisa Nandy is being
OL,7,Fquestioned by Laura Kuenssberg - watch
OL,8,Flive above
OL,10,FWhen quizzed on the upcoming UK-EU
OL,11,Fsummit, she says "it is in the interest
OL,12,Fof this country to have a much closer
OL,13,Frelationship" with Europe
OL,15,FReform UK leader Nigel Farage, former
OL,16,FEU chief negotiator Michel Barnier and
OL,17,FChief of the Defence Staff Richard
OL,18,FKnighton will also feature on the show
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/37
